      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 109,
      "text": "A matter for the council"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The council heard it. My uncle spoke first and spoke too long, which is what a man does when his case is a feeling.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "fang-qiu",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
