    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 110,
      "text": "Chapter 110"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Elder Bo asked for the dates. I gave the dates. There is a particular silence a council makes when the tedious party turns out to be the correct one.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 111,
      "text": "Chapter 111"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Adjourned for consideration. Consideration means the elders are counting who is owed what by whom, and I am not owed anything, which in this instance works in my favour.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 112,
      "text": "Chapter 112"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Used the adjournment to settle the two witnesses properly and to leave my uncle entirely alone. A man with nothing to react to looks like a man with nothing.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
